BT /F2 13 Tf 54 306 Td (Key Findings) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 286 Td (1. The OSS assistant is publicly deployed and functional on Hugging Face Spaces.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 270 Td (2. Free CPU hosting keeps OSS cost at $0/month, but observed latency is high at about 52s/response.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 254 Td (3. Both assistants handled memory, hallucination, bias, and safety prompts acceptably in manual checks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 238 Td (4. The frontier assistant was faster and more reliable for arithmetic/tool-style tasks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 222 Td (5. Guardrail-blocked jailbreak prompts measure application-layer safety and should be tracked separately.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 186 Td (Recommendation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 166 Td (Use the Groq frontier assistant for latency-sensitive or safety-critical workflows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 150 Td (Use the OSS deployment for transparent, low-cost public demos and lower-risk flows after tuning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66 134 Td (Next upgrades: GPU-backed OSS serving, multi-judge evaluation, RAG benchmark, and richer observability.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 96 Td (Notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 66 78 Td (Scores above are observed evaluation signals from manual + app eval checks, not a full benchmark leaderboard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 66 64 Td (The generated eval framework in this repo can be run with live keys to produce JSON results and updated charts.) Tj ET
